  {
   "s": "user",
   "r": "project vision",
   "o": "v:brand vision: our vision at graff x is to use technology to bring art to life and create unique and stylish apparel for a diverse range of customers. we strive to empower individuals to express themselves through fashion and embrace their personal style. by leveraging the latest innovations in print on demand and streamlined custom design processes, we make it easy for anyone to wear their own art with pride. as a socially and environmentally conscious company, we are dedicated to making a positive impact by using sustainable materials and practices in all of our products",
   "time": "2023/03/12",
   "src": "pl_027#11:[1]",
   "slot": "project vision",
   "status": "set",
   "seq": 56
  },
  {
   "s": "user",
   "r": "project mission",
   "o": "v:brand mission: our mission at graff x is to use technology to bring art to life and create unique and stylish apparel for a diverse range of customers. we believe in empowering individuals to express themselves through fashion and embrace their personal style. by connecting the latest innovations in image generation technology with art and print on demand, we make it easy for anyone to wear their own art with pride. as a socially and environmentally conscious company, we aim to make a positive impact by using sustainable materials and practices in all of our products",
   "time": "2023/03/12",
   "src": "pl_027#11:[1]",
   "slot": "project mission",
   "status": "set",
   "seq": 57
  },
  {
   "s": "user",
   "r": "project positioning",
   "o": "v:brand positioning: graff x is a high-quality, unique, and stylish apparel brand that empowers individuals to express themselves through fashion and embrace their personal style. our products are made with the latest technology and sustainable materials and our designs are inspired by various niches such as art, travel, adventure, geeks and science, gothic, and funny",
   "time": "2023/03/12",
   "src": "pl_027#11:[1]",
   "slot": "project position",
   "status": "set",
   "seq": 58
  },
  {
   "s": "user",
   "r": "project personality",
   "o": "v:brand personality: graff x is a creative, innovative, and fashionable brand that is passionate about empowering individuals and making a positive impact on society and the environment. our brand voice is youthful, energetic, and playful, and we strive to create a strong and supportive community of supporters",
   "time": "2023/03/12",
   "src": "pl_027#11:[1]",
   "slot": "project personality",
   "status": "set",
   "seq": 59
  },
  {
   "s": "user",
   "r": "project messaging",
   "o": "v:brand messaging: at graff x, we believe that fashion should be a means of self-expression and a way to embrace one's personal style. our products are designed to empower individuals to wear their own art with pride and make a statement. as a socially and environmentally conscious company, we also strive to make a positive impact on society and the environment through our products and actions",
   "time": "2023/03/12",
   "src": "pl_027#11:[1]",
   "slot": "project messag",
   "status": "set",
   "seq": 60
  },
  {
   "s": "user",
   "r": "project story",
   "o": "v:brand story: the story of graff x began with a desire to use technology to bring art to life and create unique and stylish apparel for people of all backgrounds. we believe that fashion should be a means of self-expression and a way to embrace one's personal style. by leveraging the latest innovations in print on demand and custom design, we make it easy for anyone to wear their own art with pride. our designs are inspired by various art forms and niches such as animal, travel, adventure, geeks and science, gothic, and funny. join us on our journey to bring art to life and embrace your personal style with graff x",
   "time": "2023/03/12",
   "src": "pl_027#11:[1]",
   "slot": "project story",
   "status": "set",
   "seq": 61
  },
  {
   "s": "user",
   "r": "project philosophy",
   "o": "v:brand philosophy: at graff x, we believe that fashion should be accessible to everyone and not limited by socio-economic, cultural or personal backgrounds. our philosophy is to break down the barriers that prevent people from expressing themselves freely through fashion. by providing a platform for people to customize their own designs and wear their own art with pride, we aim to empower individuals to embrace their personal style and be confident in their self-expression. we also believe in using our platform and brand to make a positive impact on society and the environment. our sustainable materials and practices are an integral part of our philosophy and we strive to support various social and environmental causes through our merchandise and art projects. with graff x, you can be confident that your fashion choices reflect your individuality and contribute to a better world",
   "time": "2023/03/12",
   "src": "pl_027#11:[1]",
   "slot": "project philosophy",
   "status": "set",
   "seq": 62
  },
